message: "Please cite both the software version used and the associated paper. This scholarly request is separate from the MIT license terms."
title: "Probabilistic Building Model"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-16"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the stationary probabilistic building model
  associated with Probabilistic modelling of buildings as networks. The package
  provides Monte Carlo collapse-size distributions, percolation threshold and
  risk-equivalence analysis, and entropy-based robustness under notional damage.
  It includes portable reproduction commands, saved scientific counts and figures.
keywords:
  - probabilistic building model
  - stationary model
  - structural robustness
  - failure propagation
  - Monte Carlo simulation
